{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05184","headline":"婺州留别邓使君 · 张循之","name":"婺州留别邓使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西掖驰名久，东阳出守时。\n江山婺女分，风月隐侯诗。\n别恨双溪急，留欢五马迟。\n回舟暎沙屿，未远剩相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张循之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}